<dt>Errata (effective with 1.0.5):</dt>
<dd>
Originally the denominator <math class="ltx_Math" altimg="m5.png" altimg-height="26px" altimg-valign="-7px" altimg-width="81px" alttext="(z-w)^{2}" display="inline"><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi href="./23.1#t1.r4" title="complex">z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></math> was given incorrectly as <math class="ltx_Math" altimg="m6.png" altimg-height="26px" altimg-valign="-7px" altimg-width="81px" alttext="(z-w^{2})" display="inline"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi href="./23.1#t1.r4" title="complex">z</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></math>.

<p><span class="ltx_font_italic">Reported 2012-02-16 by James D. Walker</span></p>
</dd>
