(= <math class="ltx_Math" altimg="m35.png" altimg-height="25px" altimg-valign="-7px" altimg-width="67px" alttext="\sigma\left(z|\mathbb{L}\right)" display="inline"><mrow><mi href="./23.2#E6" title="Weierstrass sigma function">σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi href="./23.1#t1.r4" title="complex">z</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><mi href="./23.1#t1.r1" title="lattice">𝕃</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></math> = <math class="ltx_Math" altimg="m33.png" altimg-height="25px" altimg-valign="-7px" altimg-width="104px" alttext="\sigma\left(z;g_{2},g_{3}\right)" display="inline"><mrow><mi href="./23.3#i.p3" title="Weierstrass sigma function">σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi href="./23.1#t1.r4" title="complex">z</mi><mo>;</mo><mrow><msub><mi href="./23.3#EGx1" title="Weierstrass lattice invariants 𝑔₂⁡, 𝑔₃⁡">g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi href="./23.3#EGx1" title="Weierstrass lattice invariants 𝑔₂⁡, 𝑔₃⁡">g</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></math>): Weierstrass sigma function</span></dd>
