<dd>
<a href="./23.2.E8.tex">TeX</a>, <a href="./23.2.E8.pmml">pMML</a>, <a href="./23.2.E8.png">png</a>
</dd>
<dt>See also:</dt>
<dd>Annotations for <a href="./23.2#ii.info" title="§23.2(ii) Weierstrass Elliptic Functions ‣ §23.2 Definitions and Periodic Properties ‣ Weierstrass Elliptic Functions ‣ Chapter 23 Weierstrass Elliptic and Modular Functions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§23.2(ii)</span></a>,
