<div id="iii.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p class="ltx_p">For further quasi-periodic properties of the <math class="ltx_Math" altimg="m30.png" altimg-height="13px" altimg-valign="-2px" altimg-width="17px" alttext="\sigma" display="inline"><mi href="./23.2#E6" title="Weierstrass sigma function">σ</mi></math>-function see
